# Unreal binary assets must never be treated as text: no line-ending conversion,
# no textual diff, no accidental merge of two binary revisions into a corrupt file.
# Deliberately no `* text=auto` and no eol rules - adding them now would make Git
# want to renormalize every already-committed source file. Only declare the binaries.
*.uasset  binary
*.umap    binary
*.uexp    binary
*.ubulk   binary
*.ufont   binary
*.locres  binary
*.locmeta binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.bmp     binary
*.ico     binary
*.dll     binary
*.lib     binary
*.pdb     binary
*.exe     binary
*.zip     binary
